Persephone is planned to be a robotic spacecraft which is able to:
1. Travel to and enter orbit around planets and moons in our solar system;
2. Transport payloads for robotic manufacturing and refueling;
3. Start the process of assembling copies of itself for the purposes of
	exploration in the solar system and Kuiper Belt.

Outline for Persephone roadmap:
I. Obtain grant funding for:
	A. Research
	B. Robotic prototyping

II. Create marketing materials to enable funding and capture mindshare:
	A. AI-assisted videos to support grant proposals
	B. Website to foster storage and distribution of whitepaper materials
	C. Substack to foster discussion/conversation in the community
	D. Identify potential partners with similar interests and motivations

III. Design prototype robot:
	A. Establish roadmap for Persephone generations
	B. 
